Schema migration diff: legacy schema (branch validation-B) -> new pipeline schema (main)
=========================================================================================

Reproduce the underlying full diff with:

    git diff validation-B main -- oxford_notebook/src oxford_notebook/viz \
                                  oxford_notebook/config oxford_notebook/notebooks

This file is a filtered EXCERPT of that diff. Kept are only changed lines whose change is
caused by the schema itself:

  * DataOrigin literal     'Oscilloscope'        -> 'ET200_Data'
  * G-code column          HFBlockEvent_GCode    -> NcCode + NcComment, concatenated in SQL
                                                    as GCode_Label
  * probe counter          HFProbeCounter        -> Cycle
  * signal label           Description           -> COALESCE(Label, Description, Signal)
                                                    AS Signal_Label
  * additional columns     WCS_Source, Label, IpoGC (no legacy counterpart)
  * tool signal literal    actToolIdent[u1,1]    -> actToolIdent[u1]
  * column types           Platte VARCHAR, Nut DOUBLE -> Platte INTEGER, Nut INTEGER
                                                    (7x str(plate) -> int(plate))

Excluded are changes that accompany the migration but are not schema changes: the
NoSignalBearingChannelsError guard, the empty-DataFrame guard in create_axiswise_plots2,
the NULL-NcCode guard in filter_unique_gcodes, provenance headers, dead-code comments and
reformatting. Line counts per file are given below.

The hunks are excerpts, so this file does not apply with `git apply`; the @@ headers give
the position in the full diff.


